      "locked": false,
      "text": "GATT Ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 \u00DCzerinden RSSI Okuma: E\u011Fer cihaz sizin kendi kontrol\u00FCn\u00FCzdeki\nbir al\u0131c\u0131ya (\u00F6rne\u011Fin haz\u0131rlad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z bir merkezi ESP32 sistemine) ba\u011Fl\u0131ysa, reklam\nyay\u0131nlamasa bile aktif ba\u011Flant\u0131 \u00FCzerinden readRSSI() fonksiyonu ile sinyal g\u00FCc\u00FC\nanl\u0131k olarak \u00E7ekilebilir.",
